From 3fb3229bfb6a22dee14f2a88379eb165950e118e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mika Laitio <mika.laitio@amd.com>
Date: Thu, 17 Sep 2026 00:41:59 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Enable dynamic INT8 MoE on target GPUs

Adds dynamic INT8 MoE support for gfx90a,
gfx1100, and gfx1201.
Fixes gfx1100 dynamic INT8 MoE by routing it
through AITER's Triton SmoothQuant kernel because
CK Quant2 crashes.

Reason:
- CK Quant2 stage two used unsupported BF16 atomic
  accumulation on gfx90a and gfx1201.
- CK Quant2 crashes during stage one on gfx1100.

Fix:
- Add Quant2 CK kernels for gfx90a and gfx1201.
- Accumulate stage two in FP32 before casting.
- Route gfx1100 dynamic INT8 MoE through AITER's
  Triton SmoothQuant kernel.
- Build grouped routing data from top-k inputs.

Testing
- Cover small and prefill-sized routing cases.

Tools used:
- GPT: 5.6 Sol

Signed-off-by: Mika Laitio <mika.laitio@amd.com>
